            "acc_id1": "descriptions",
            "accordion_heading1": "Why take monthlies?",
            "dsc1": "<ul><li><strong>Wondering \"why do I have to suffer from painful cramps every month?\"<br/></strong>Period pain, also known as dysmenorrhea, is normally caused by prostaglandins - hormone-like chemicals found all over the body. The prostaglandins in the female reproductive tract help to regulate ovulation, menstruation, and labour. Prostaglandins cause the muscles of the uterus to contract - and this causes the pain you experience just before, and during your period. Those who have more prostaglandins usually experience more period pain. <strong>You can lower it by supporting your body with nutrient supplementation, diet and lifestyle changes, improving your period pain for good! </strong> </li></ul><p></p><ul><li><strong>Factors Contributing:</strong> In today’s world, we are faced with heightened stress, hormone-disrupting chemicals, and nutrient-depleted food - f<strong>actors that can contribute to hormonal imbalances causing period pain and related symptoms </strong>such as cramps, bloating, mood swings, low energy, etc. </li><li>When pain begins, it's often too late to act naturally; which is why women have traditionally turned to painkillers that offer <strong>only</strong> temporary relief. <strong>We, however, refuse to accept that women should rely on quick fixes for life—or that menstrual pain should be seen as \"normal</strong>\". Our goal was to create a natural solution that addresses the root causes, offering long-term relief and empowering women to take control of their cycle and invest in their next period. </li></ul><p><br/>Created by five female doctors and women’s health professionals after personally helping over 2,500 women escape period pain at their clinics, monthlies brings together 26 of the most advanced natural ingredients to help tackle period cramps, replenish nutrient stores, support hormonal balance, and promote overall well-being.</p>"
          }
        },
        "left_p6Eh8w": {
          "type": "left",
          "settings": {
            "acc_id1": "How to take it",
            "accordion_heading1": "How to take it",
            "dsc1": "<p>Taking monthlies is simple and convenient. Add one scoop (7.4 grams) to 300ml of water or your favourite beverage once a day.</p><p>For optimal results, we <strong>recommend taking it in the morning, ideally with food,</strong> as it can provide a gentle energy boost that supports you through your day. monthlies has a naturally tropical and gingery taste, so water works perfectly! </p><p><strong>Taking it daily can help build nutrient reserves in the body and deliver the best benefits across your cycle.  </strong></p><p>Although you will start noticing results in the first few weeks, waiting three months for full product effects is essential because hormones work through intricate feedback loops and need time to adapt to changes. Female hormones typically operate on monthly cycles, so it can take two to three cycles for your body to adjust fully to any new hormonal pattern. </p>"
          }
        },
        "left_XkhVmH": {
          "type": "left",
          "settings": {
            "acc_id1": "what-makes-it-different",
            "accordion_heading1": "What makes it different?",
            "dsc1": "<p>Women of reproductive age often need a range of <strong>essential nutrients to maintain hormonal balance and general wellness</strong>, yet clinical data shows that many adult women are deficient in key nutrients like Folate, Choline, Vitamin D, and Iron. monthlies not only helps replenish these critical nutrients, but also includes a blend of clinically-backed ingredients in high absorbable forms such as Zinc, Chormium, Magnesium, Choline, Vitamin B6, Calcium, Inositol, Ginger, Turmeric, Lemon Balm etc to support menstrual health. </p><p>monthlies is a one-of-a-kind supplement solution, specifically designed to support your menstrual cycle and overall health. </p><p>This powerful formula is crafted to support menstrual pain and other symptoms, reduce bloating, improve sleep, boost energy, manage stress, improve mood, support blood sugar regulation, support digestion, enhance skin and hair health giving you comprehensive care in one supplement*. </p><p> Even more reasons to choose monthlies! </p><ul><li><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">All you need: </span>26+ ingredients combined in 1 scoop per day, so no need to invest in multiple supplements for the same benefits </li><li><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Highly absorbable ingredients</span>: We've used vitamins like Folate, B6, B12 in their active (methylated) forms for superior absorption and quality </li><li><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Superior sourcing:</span> We have partnered with UK labs that have transparent and trusted sourcing </li><li><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">CGMP Certified: </span>We only work with CGMP certified supplier and manufacturers </li><li><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Natural ingredients:</span> We strive to always use natural ingredients with as little additives as possible </li><li><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Designed by experts: </span>Created by a diverse team of female health experts with 10+ years of clinical knowledge and experience of helping over 2,500 women </li><li><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Science meets clinical expertise: </span>Our formula merges science-backed ingredients with clinical expert knowledge </li><li><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Third- party tested:</span> for all dietary preferences: vegan, dairy- free, nut-free, soy-free, gluten-free </li></ul>"
          }
        },
        "right_w3eznD": {
          "type": "right",
          "settings": {
            "acc_id": "isthisproductforme",
            "accordion_heading": "How does the formula work?",
            "dsc": "<p>We, at monthlies, understand that menstrual pain is often caused by a range of factors that disrupt hormone balance. That’s why, our supplement works from within, replenishing essential nutrients with highly-absorbable ingredients, so your body can use them to the fullest. </p><p>It includes <strong>key vitamins, nutrients and plant extracts that support natural processes to tackle inflammation, optimise hormone metabolism, and promote efficient hormone elimination*.</strong></p><p><br/>Together, these elements help balance hormones and ease common menstrual symptoms - leading to a smoother, more comfortable cycle. <br/><br/>Plus, <strong>monthlies’ holistic formula supports overall health, enhancing skin, hair, mood, and energy levels* — helping you feel your best every day.</strong></p>"
          }
        },
        "right_4JyJAQ": {
          "type": "right",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "acc_id": "direction",
            "accordion_heading": "Directions",
            "dsc": "<ul><li>Mix 1 scoop (7.4 grams) of monthlies powder in 300ml of water or liquid of choice.  </li><li>We recommend taking this product in the morning with food </li><li>We recommend taking this product for 3 months to see full results </li><li>Do not exceed the recommended daily dose  </li><li>Safe for all stages of life: menstruation, perimenopause, menopause </li><li>Food supplements should not be used as a substitute for a balanced diet and healthy lifestyle </li><li>This product is not recommended for children, pregnant or breastfeeding women </li><li>If you are taking a medication, have a thyroid condition, or under the super medical supervision, please speak with your doctor before using monthlies  </li><li>Speak to your doctor before taking monthlies if you are taking the birth control pill or any other medication </li><li>Store in a cool dry place away from moisture and direct sunlight </li><li>Keep out of reach of children </li><li>Do not use if the seal is broken or if the bottle has been opened  </li><li>This product contains 30 servings per bottle, a 1-month supply </li></ul><p> </p>"
          }
        },
        "right_fmXVBa": {
          "type": "right",
          "settings": {
            "acc_id": "benefits",
            "accordion_heading": "Benefits",
            "dsc": "<p>We recognise that the menstrual cycle affects much more than just period pain. It influences everything from sleep and digestion to mood, energy, and skin. That’s why we created a product that not only helps with menstrual symptoms but also supports your body’s natural processes, reduces period discomfort, and enhances overall health. </p><p>Here are some key benefits of our formula, along with the ingredients that make it possible: </p><ul><li><strong>Hormone Support: Vitamin </strong>B6 </li><li><strong>Energy Production</strong>: Magnesium, B Vitamins, and Iron </li><li><strong>Anti-Inflammatory</strong>: Turmeric </li><li><strong>Mood</strong>: Lemon Balm, B6 </li><li><strong>Digestion</strong>: Aniseed </li><li><strong>Sleep</strong>: Lemon Balm </li><li><strong>Blood Sugar Support</strong>: Chromium </li><li><strong>Skin, Hair and Nail: </strong>Vitamin A, Vitamin C, Biotin, and Zinc </li><li><strong>Immune Health:</strong> Vitamin A, Vitamin C, Selenium, Zinc </li></ul><p> *These statements are based on scientific research on menstrual health, ingredient efficacy, and approved or on-hold EFSA claims.</p><p>Why a powder? To deliver the same effective dosages in capsules, you'd need to take around 16 every day. That's why we chose a powder; it enables us to include everything your body actually needs, in the right amounts, with the best absorbable forms, without compromise.</p><p>Alongside our powerful formula, we provide hormone education, personalised nutrition guidance, and practical lifestyle tips to help support your body’s journey to a healthier period. Our goal is to empower you to take control of your hormonal health, experience lasting changes, and feel your best every single day. </p>"
          }
        }
      },
