            "accordion_heading": "Lemon Balm",
            "small_description": "<p>An ancient aromatic herb prized for its calming and antispasmodic properties.</p>",
            "dsc": "<ul><li>An ancient aromatic herb prized for its calming and antispasmodic properties, Lemon Balm has been scientifically proven to reduce mild anxiety symptoms by up to 36% .</li><li>Its ability to <strong>alleviate menstrual cramps and bloating</strong> makes it a powerful natural remedy for period pain.</li><li> It also improves mood, digestion, and cognitive function, providing holistic support during PMS and beyond.</li></ul>"
