            "accordion_heading": "Inositol",
            "small_description": "<p>A carbohydrate essential for hormonal balance, cell signalling, and metabolic health.</p>",
            "dsc": "<ul><li>A carbohydrate essential for hormonal balance, cell signalling, and metabolic health, Inositol plays a vital role in improving ovarian health and menstrual regularity. Extensively studied for its effectiveness in individuals with PCOS, it <strong>reduces androgen levels, enhances ovulatory function, and shortens irregular cycle lengths.</strong></li></ul>"
