        "second_heading": "Your monthlies <strong>journey.</strong>",
        "image_ratio": "adapt",
        "image_position": "center center",
        "text_alignment": "left",
        "show_divider": false,
        "heading": "It’s not magic, it`s <strong>science</strong><em>.</em>",
        "description": "Healthy hormones require a steady supply of essential nutrients, along with supportive lifestyle habits, to function at their best.               That's why, <strong>after treating over 500 women and observing menstrual issues for over 10 years,</strong> our clinicians came together to create monthlies— a supplement tailored to replenish nutrient stores, support hormone balance, address menstrual symptoms, and promote overall well-being.",
        "heading_size": "h1",
        "heading_alignment": "left",
        "heading_tag": "h2",
        "min_count": "30",
        "mid_count": "60",
        "max_count": "90",
        "count": "30",
        "title1": "<p>Experience the progress</p>",
        "text1": "<p><strong>In 30 days</strong>, you'll start noticing the powder's impact, with <strong> </strong>boosted energy and a gentle uplift in your mood.</p>",
        "title2": "<p>Unleash inner vitality</p>",
        "text2": "<p>In 60-days, you see <strong>tangible results:</strong> menstrual symptoms are mitigated, skin gains a healthy radiance, and you get balanced energy.</p>",
        "title3": "<p>Thrive in harmony</p>",
        "text3": "<p>In 90 days, <strong> you’ll feel reduced discomfort, and will enjoy </strong> a more regular cycle, heightened vitality and performance, radiant skin, and stable moods.</p>",
        "de_title1": "<p>Spüre die Verbesserung</p>",
        "de_text1": "<p><strong>Nach 30 Tagen</strong> wirst du die Wirkung des Pulvers erstmals spüren: mehr Energie und eine leichte Stimmungsaufhellung.</p>",
        "de_title2": "<p>Entfessle innere Vitalität</p>",
        "de_text2": "<p>In 60 Tagen wirst du spürbare <strong>Veränderungen bemerken: </strong>Menstruationsbeschwerden sind gelindert, deine Haut strahlt gesund und deine Energie ist ausgeglichen.</p>",
        "de_title3": "<p>Blühe in Harmonie auf</p>",
        "de_text3": "<p>In 90 Tagen wirst du dich über einen regelmäßigeren Zyklus, mehr Vitalität und Leistungsfähigkeit, strahlende Haut und ausgeglichene Stimmung freuen.</p>",
        "mobile_text_alignment": "left",
        "columns_mobile": "1",
        "swipe_on_mobile": false,
        "padding_top": 0,
        "padding_bottom": 36
      }
    },
