            "title": "Dr.  Maria Obando, MD",
            "title_size": "h3",
            "text": "<p>“monthlies supports this vital system with 26 science-backed, natural ingredients, addressing root causes of symptoms like period pain, bloating, fatigue, and mood swings. It truly is a one-stop solution for menstrual wellness.”</p>",
