            "title": "Melissa Mastroberardino, RHN",
            "title_size": "h3",
            "text": "<p>“It’s astonishing how many women believe period pain is normal and ‘just part of being a woman.’ When women think of health, they often focus on weight, digestion, or skin, but rarely on cycles.\"</p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": "",
