            "title": "Dr. Cassandra Paiano, BSc,ND",
            "title_size": "h3",
            "text": "<p>“No two women experience their cycles the same way, which is why I appreciate the versatility of monthlies. Its formula is designed to address a variety of symptoms—from period pain and digestive discomfort to lack of energy and mood swings.”</p>",
