    "timeline_section_AaRkbb": {
      "type": "timeline-section",
      "blocks": {
        "cycle_WreCWG": {
          "type": "cycle",
          "settings": {
            "cycle_heading": "Cycle 1",
            "cycle_text": "<p>In your first month with monthlies, your body starts replenishing essential nutrients to support <strong>steadier energy, improved sleep, and a balanced mood</strong>. Early hormonal adjustments uniquely <strong>target bloating and digestive sluggishness, normalising oestrogen metabolism and fluid balance</strong>, and laying the groundwork for deeper hormonal recalibration ahead.*</p>"
          }
        },
        "cycle_RWVGkQ": {
          "type": "cycle",
          "settings": {
            "cycle_heading": "Cycle 2",
            "cycle_text": "<p>By the second month, hormonal pathways stabilise, <strong>reducing bloating, water retention, and mood swings</strong>. Improved harmony between oestrogen and progesterone results in more controlled prostaglandin production, <strong>easing cramps and inflammation</strong>. Enhanced nutrient absorption supports <strong>smoother digestion and a more predictable cycle and fewer PMS symptoms</strong>.*</p>"
          }
        },
        "cycle_UF338a": {
          "type": "cycle",
          "settings": {
            "cycle_heading": "Cycle 3",
            "cycle_text": "<p>By this stage, your body has reached a deeper reset. <strong>Inflammation, hormonal imbalances, and prostaglandin surges are under control</strong>, leading to <strong>ease in cramps, stable weight, and improved cycle consistency</strong>. Other benefits are <strong>sustained energy, clearer skin, and smoother digestion</strong>, supporting overall hormonal resilience and smoother cycles in the long term.*</p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "cycle_WreCWG",
        "cycle_RWVGkQ",
        "cycle_UF338a"
      ],
      "settings": {
        "heading": "Feel the difference: <span>What you can expect</span> from monthlies journey.",
        "main_image": "shopify://shop_images/Picture_1.png",
        "cycle_paragraph": "<p>* These statements are based on scientific research on menstrual health, ingredients efficacy, and approved or on-hold EFSA claims. </p><p>References/studies here: <a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/monthlies-studies\" target=\"_blank\">https://tinyurl.com/monthlies-studies</a></p>"
      }
    },
